# "Search your library for a basic land card" (CR 205.4a): an Overgrown Tomb, a nonbasic land with basic land types, is not
# offered while the Forest is. A search for a quality may find nothing (CR 701.23b): on turn 3 a second Vista is cracked for
# no card at all, and is still sacrificed with its life paid. 20 - 1 - 1 = 18.

[Bot1 Deck]
Prismatic Vista
Prismatic Vista
Island x5
Overgrown Tomb
Forest
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Prismatic Vista.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Prismatic Vista.Activate
! Bot1.Search(Overgrown Tomb)
Bot1.Search(Forest)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Prismatic Vista.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Prismatic Vista.Activate
Bot1.Search()

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 18
Bot1.Graveyard = Prismatic Vista; Prismatic Vista
Bot1.Battlefield = Forest
